\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/06LR}{\texttt{Stacks tag 06LR}}


Let $S$ be a scheme.
Let $f : X \to Y$ be a morphism of algebraic spaces over $S$.
Let $d \in \{0, 1, 2, \ldots\}$.
