\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03Z7}{\texttt{Stacks tag 03Z7}}


Let $S$ be a scheme.
Let $f : X \to Y$ be a morphism of algebraic spaces over $S$.
\begin{enumerate}
