\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EMM}{\texttt{Stacks tag 0EMM}}


Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$, $Y$ be algebraic spaces over $S$.
\begin{enumerate}
\item Let $f : U \to Y$, $g : V \to Y$ be morphisms of algebraic spaces
